    "summary": "The cheap tier now defaults to cli-claude / haiku in DEFAULT_TIERS, the config catalog and the plugin manifest; the installer's claude choice writes cheap haiku and its codex choice writes gpt-6-astra, gpt-6.1-sol and gpt-6-luna (both copies); the shipped cloud catalog lists the three GPT-6 Codex models; the summariser follows the cheap tier and pins its model for a CLI, replacing an Ollama-shaped id with the built-in cheap model for that CLI (haiku, gpt-6-luna) so the CLI default never runs; docs, site pages and stale comments name the new values. Existing config files are unchanged.",
